// t_7cc742ed.  Measured against sce-cgc 475.
// The hand-expanded spelling that ALL FIVE paste rows must equal.  Measured,
// not assumed: left, right, both, the nested ID(CAT(...)) and the ordinary
// local-variable paste all produce one container on the reference
// (43a4ac87280b) and one here (29a658971f7e), so the parenthesisation of the
// nested row and the local of the plain row both fold away and this single
// literal is the control for every one of them.  The rows are byte-compared
// against it so they pin the VALUE the macro expands to and not merely that
// the file was accepted - an accept-only row is what let the pre-revision-4
// per-parameter rule look right (codex's condition, endorsed by Fable).
float4 main(float4 t : TEXCOORD0) : COLOR { return t * 2.0; }
